<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">reinforced travel pack</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

A masterwork <ansi fg="itemname">reinforced travel pack</ansi> with an internal
bone frame that distributes heavy loads with remarkable ease.
The best weight reduction available for the <ansi fg="yellow">Back</ansi> slot.

